<title>USA: Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. wins $35 mln Texas A&amp;M notes.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. wins $35 mln Texas A&amp;M notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lycnh &amp; Co. said it won the Board of Regents of the Texas A&amp;M University System's $35 million permanent university fund (PUF) subordinate lien notes, Series B.</p>
<p>The true interest cost (TIC) was 3.20 percent. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
